<p><strong>Date basis:</strong> {{ ['assigned'=>'Assigned (creation date)','due'=>'Due deadline (current deadline)','approved'=>'Approval date'][request('basis','due')] }}. The inclusive date range is interpreted in Africa/Johannesburg. Every count uses this selected task cohort; choosing “due” does not count assignments made during the period.</p><p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>First-submission on-time rate:</strong> on-time first submissions / non-cancelled tasks with at least one submission. Each attempt is compared with its retained deadline. Accepted punctuality uses the approved attempt. Approval delays do not affect submission punctuality.</p><p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Open:</strong> assigned, in progress, or changes requested. Awaiting review is separate. Overdue is calculated against the current deadline for tasks not approved or cancelled. Correction counts include all returned attempts. Cancelled tasks appear in selected task counts and detail, and are excluded from punctuality denominators.</p><p style="margin-top:8px">Categories and priorities provide context. Task counts are not a complete productivity score. No time tracking is implemented; elapsed time is not hours worked.</p>
